  "question": "Which fast food is closest on the corridor from Elyria Arts Council, Elyria, OH to Akron Children's Hospital NICU at Summa, Akron, OH?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-82.105078 41.367311)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.50133 41.080742)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'fast_food'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-82.105078 41.367311)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-82.105078 41.367311)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
